00:19:16.088 --> 00:19:19.057
<i>Festival Olahraga Nasional 2024</i>

406
00:19:19.058 --> 00:19:21.060
<i>peraih medali emas tinju kelas welter.</i>

407
00:19:21.627 --> 00:19:23.329
<i>Dari tim tinju Kabupaten Hwasun,</i>

408
