462
00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:41.866
Baiklah.

463
00:21:41.867 --> 00:21:43.068
- Mengerti.
- [saudara laki-laki] Semoga beruntung.

464
00:21:44.303 --> 00:21:45.738
[keluarga] Ayo pergi!

465
00:21:46.405 --> 00:21:47.572
[produser] Anda harus membaca

466
00:21:47.573 --> 00:21:49.275
