- Oh, ayolah.

467
00:21:50.643 --> 00:21:52.278
[♪ musik lembut diputar]

468
00:21:59.618 --> 00:22:00.619
[mendengus]

469
00:22:02.521 --> 00:22:05.324
[Hyunjae] <i>"Aku selalu berharap kamu bisa
ikuti jalanmu sendiri."</i>

470
00:22:05.991 --> 00:22:07.092
